0..79 Comment "//! `cancel-orders` reaps a target and cancellation completion in either order."
80..83 Comment "//!"
84..161 Comment "//! Cancellation and its target owe independent completions. Cancellation can"
162..217 Comment "//! also take and reap the target\'s pending completion."
218..221 Comment "//!"
222..301 Comment "//! The checker tracks each completion as a separate endpoint. `cancelConsumes`"
302..353 Comment "//! transfers the pending endpoint to cancellation."
354..357 Comment "//!"
358..374 Comment "//! - see: #1229"
